{#
TemplateOrderRule fixture — FAIL case.

Component template that violates the canonical top-level order. The
`set component` statement appears BEFORE the `extends` directive — the
parent template can't be loaded yet because the child hasn't declared
which parent it extends.

Run: vendor/bin/twig-cs-fixer lint --config tests/config/twig-wordpress.php tests/Fixtures/Twig/template-order-fail-fixture.twig
Expected: 1 warning, 0 errors (TemplateOrder)
#}
